          objective: 'Win stakes through the Hoc-family combinations and play sequence while using the borrowing option better than the other players.',
          gameplay: 'Set the pack according to player count, deal the prescribed hands and talon, then play the Hoc-style stages. The distinguishing feature is that players may borrow a card they do not have under the documented rule, creating tactical access to otherwise missing combinations.',
